@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<div class="page narrow">
    <h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <p>Cinemax stores the email address and password hash you register with, plus any reviews you post. If you sign in with Google or GitHub, Cinemax receives basic profile details from that service.</p>
    <p>Your email address is not shown on the site. Reviews appear with the name you enter. Cinemax does not sell your data.</p>
</div>
